# Output contract

- Return **one JSON object only** (reportSpec). No markdown fences. No commentary.
- Do not return free-form essay prompt text.
- Do not write SQL, YAML, or tool calls.
- Required keys:
  - `title` (short)
  - `objective` (1–2 short business sentences)
  - `reportType`
  - `columns` — array of `{ "key", "label", "formula?" }`
  - `filters` — array of `{ "field", "op", "value" }` (omit when none)
  - `groupBy` — array of field keys (may be empty)
  - `sort` — `{ "field", "direction" }` or null
  - `sourceSchema` / `sourceTable` — the preferred fact table from the schema slice
  - `availableColumns` — schema-backed column keys the UI may add
  - `warnings` — client-visible gaps only (e.g. missing Score)
- Keep objective and titles short for client display.
- `sourceTable` must be the preferred items/form table (`ezfb_*_items` or `items_*`). Never `Workflows`, `Repositories`, or `wForm`.
- Prefer concrete Matched_Status / status values only when they appear in the approved schema; otherwise use `"op": "not_null"` or omit the filter. Never invent status strings from the user description.
- Formulas must be simple (`A + B`, `SUM(Amount)`, `COUNT(*)`) and reference schema-backed fields only.
